SUMMARY:EscapeOS v0.1.8
DESCRIPTION:EscapeOS 0.1.8 | EscapeOS-0.1.8\n\n## EscapeOS 0.1.8\n\nv0.1.0\
 , v0.1.1\, v0.1.3\, v0.1.4\, v0.1.5\, and v0.1.6 are unchanged. 0.1.7 was 
 never published\; its two fixes are in this release.\n\n### Fixed\n- **Imp
 ort from Files works again for new files and Keep Both.** Since 0.1.6 both
  failed with "That folder is outside this app's data." An app's container 
 is reported under `/private/var`\, and the folder check only stripped that
  prefix for paths that already exist ([#4](https://github.com/pwnapplehat/
 EscapeOS/issues/4)).\n- **`InvalidHostID` now explains itself.** It means 
 the device does not recognise EscapeOS's pairing file. The message used to
  blame LocalDevVPN and Wi-Fi ([#5](https://github.com/pwnapplehat/EscapeOS
 /issues/5)).\n- **Sharing a file can no longer delete EscapeOS's own data.
 ** Share wrote into EscapeOS's Documents and replaced whatever had that na
 me\, so sharing a file called `Backups` or `pairingFile.plist` removed eve
 ry backup or the pairing file. Shares now use a private temporary folder.\
 n\n### Added ([#3](https://github.com/pwnapplehat/EscapeOS/issues/3)\, [#4
 ](https://github.com/pwnapplehat/EscapeOS/issues/4))\n- **Search Whole App
 ** finds a file or folder by name anywhere in an app's data.\n- **Favorite
 s** at the top of the Apps tab\; they still open after an app is reinstall
 ed.\n- **Replace / Keep Both / Cancel when pasting** a name that already e
 xists. A folder is never replaced\, a file is never replaced by itself\, a
 nd Replace swaps the file in atomically so a failure leaves the original.\
 n- **Free-space check** before Compress\, Share Zip\, Duplicate\, Paste\, 
 Import and Backup\, with a clear message instead of a late failure.\n- **S
 hare / Save to Files** on each backup.\n\n### Changed\n- **Deleting a file
  now asks first**\, naming what will be deleted. Files can opt out with "D
 elete\, Don't Ask Again" (Settings turns it back on)\; folders and backup 
 archives always ask.\n\nTheos arm64 IPA (iPhoneOS 16.5 SDK\, `MinimumOSVer
 sion` 18.0)\, same build path as 0.1.6. After install\, r
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/escapeos.json
